        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>SCHEDULE R, PART II, LINE 1:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>CALIFORNIA INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY IS THE SPONSOR OF THE PLAN AND THE ADMINISTRATOR OF THE TRUST. SCHEDULE R, PART V, LINE 1C: CALTECH MAKES CONTRIBUTIONS TO THE TRUST ACCORDING TO A FUNDING ARRANGEMENT WITH NASA THAT IS STIPULATED IN THE CONTRACT BETWEEN CALTECH AND NASA FOR THE MANAGEMENT OF JPL. SCHEDULE R, PART V, LINE 1M: CALTECH EMPLOYEES PERFORM ADMINISTRATIVE SERVICES FOR THE TRUST. SUCH SERVICES ARE PART OF THE NORMAL COURSE OF SUCH EMPLOYEES' DUTIES IN ADMINISTERING CALTECH'S BENEFIT PLANS, AND CALTECH RECEIVES NO REIMBURSEMENT FOR SUCH SERVICE TO THE TRUST. THEREFORE, THE AFOREMENTIONED SERVICES ARE NOT RECORDED AS CONTRIBUTIONS TO THE TRUST. SCHEDULE R, PART V, LINE 1Q: CALTECH CONTRIBUTES TO THE TRUST TO FUND EXTERNAL ADMINISTRATIVE COSTS, SUCH AS RECORDKEEPING, INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT AND AUDIT EXPENSES.</ExplanationTxt>
